        <mxCell id="Ow_ghiLrk13JmR1oZ4iC-2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Function Requirement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;user should be able to register into out application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;List Down all the nearby restaurants based on user location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Search dishes, menu, restaurants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;shows all the menu of selected restaurants&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;User should able to select various Items in the cart make the payment to confirm order from nearest restaurants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;once restaurants accecpt - find the nearby derlivery partner based on driver location. and optimized delivery time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;once delivery partner pickup the order , give almost real time location of delivery partner to customer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;User should get notify all stages and get past orders in the profiles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt