        <mxCell id="Ow_ghiLrk13JmR1oZ4iC-71" value="High Level Service- Design" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=3" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1200" y="1003" width="240" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ow_ghiLrk13JmR1oZ4iC-72" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Users → LB + Gateway: Authentication, rate limiting, routing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;User Service → User DB (PostgreSQL): User profiles, addresses, preferences&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Search Service - Elastic Search&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Cart Service - Cart DB (Redis) shoping cart statetment , session management&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Order Service - Order DB (SQL)&amp;nbsp; Maintain order life cycle, ACID transaction, Kafka, Event -Driven order life cycle (order_placed, restaurant_accepted, delivery_partner_assigned), check invetory, validate order&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Payment Service - Payment Gateway, payment Processing , transaction&amp;nbsp; managemnt&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Driver Matching Service : Driver DB+Redis, Geo Spatial Matching , Tracking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Restaurant Service : Kafka-&amp;nbsp; Notify when order_placed , update preparation status&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;Notification Service : Push notification to user, restaurants, delivery_partner&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);&quot;&gt;websocker gateway : Real Time location tracking and order status updates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1190" y="1053" width="1170" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
